Twemoji 14.0.2 regional-indicator flag faces, clipped to Twemoji's
waving fabric (U+1F3F3, pole omitted) and cropped uniformly to Apple
Color Emoji ribbon aspect (~1.42). Rasterized at 32 / 64 / 96 px.

Sources are fetched at build time from jsDelivr:
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@14.0.2/assets/svg/

